WEBVTT

31:31.374 --> 31:32.750
- Already?
- " Oh!

31:35.670 --> 31:38.381
- The gods gave me one blessing.
- (LAUGHS)

31:38.506 --> 31:39.549
(DOOR OPENS)

31:43.261 --> 31:45.763
- Don't get up.
- My lord.

31:45.889 --> 31:49.559
Should I explain to you the meaning of
a closed door in a whorehouse, brother?

31:49.684 --> 31:51.728
You have much to teach me, no doubt,

31:51.853 --> 31:55.023
but our sister craves your attention.

31:55.732 --> 31:57.734
She has odd cravings, our sister.

31:57.859 --> 31:59.903
A family trait.
